# benches/

Criterion benchmarks for server performance testing. Includes direct datastore layer benchmarks and end-to-end service benchmarks to measure overhead at each layer.

## Files

- `postgres_datastore.rs` -- PostgreSQL datastore layer benchmarks; isolates query execution and connection-pool overhead by bypassing gRPC
